#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:18
msgid "WP Agent Bridge Documentation & Quick Guide"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:21
msgid "WP Agent Bridge is an enterprise-grade, lightweight, and ultra-secure inspection plugin for WordPress & WooCommerce. It exposes a protected, 100% read-only REST API (agent-bridge/v1/) allowing AI coding assistants (Antigravity, Cursor, Claude, ChatGPT) and developer tools to safely audit, diagnose bugs, and inspect live site architecture without requiring risky SSH, SFTP, or database credentials."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:30
msgid "Getting Started in 4 Quick Steps"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:33
msgid "Follow these simple steps to connect your AI assistant to this WordPress installation in less than two minutes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:40
msgid "Verify Permissions & Token"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:42
msgid "Make sure your Bearer token is active in the General tab, and select which data modules your AI is allowed to query in the Permissions Matrix tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:45
msgid "Configure Permissions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:53
msgid "Copy the AI Mega-Prompt"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:55
msgid "Open the \"AI Mega-Prompt & Skill\" tab and click the copy button. The prompt is automatically pre-filled with your live site URL, active Bearer token, and available endpoints."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:58
msgid "Go to AI Mega-Prompt Tab"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:66
msgid "Paste into your AI Assistant"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:68
msgid "Paste the entire copied prompt into your chat session with Antigravity, Cursor, Claude Desktop, or ChatGPT. Your AI will instantly understand how to inspect the site safely."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:76
msgid "Audit, Diagnose & Build"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:78
msgid "Ask your AI to inspect recent WooCommerce fatal errors, analyze theme overrides, or examine custom WPCode & Code Snippets. The AI queries the endpoints via curl with zero SSH needed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:89
msgid "How It Works & Security Architecture"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:92
msgid "WP Agent Bridge has been engineered from the ground up for maximum safety on high-traffic production environments."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:99
msgid "100% Read-Only Guarantee"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:100
msgid "Every single endpoint strictly enforces HTTP GET (WP_REST_Server::READABLE). There are zero POST, PUT, or DELETE routes. The plugin contains no modification or execution primitives, ensuring your database and site files remain completely untouched."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:107
msgid "Bearer Token Authentication"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:108
msgid "Requests must supply an Authorization: Bearer header. The 64-character cryptographically secure token can be rotated at any time with 1 click in admin, or permanently hardcoded via WP_AGENT_BRIDGE_TOKEN in wp-config.php."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:115
msgid "Anti-Brute-Force & IP Lockout"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:116
msgid "Failed authentication attempts are automatically tracked per client IP. After exceeding the threshold, offending IPs are locked out with HTTP 429 responses. Active lockouts can be monitored and unlocked with 1 click in the admin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:123
msgid "Real-Time Secret & PII Redaction"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:124
msgid "Before returning any JSON response, an integrated redaction engine systematically masks Stripe secret keys (sk_live_*), payment gateway secrets, database passwords, salts, and customer email addresses."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:131
msgid "Memory-Safe Log Streaming"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:132
msgid "Large log files (debug.log and WooCommerce logs) are extracted from the bottom up using reverse file pointer (fseek). This guarantees low memory consumption and avoids PHP out-of-memory errors on heavy sites."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:139
msgid "Audit Trail & GeoIP Analytics"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:140
msgid "All incoming API requests are logged in a lightweight table with timestamps, IP addresses, country flags (via Cloudflare header or cached GeoIP), endpoints, and HTTP response status codes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:150
msgid "Inspectable Technical Data"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:153
msgid "Here is the technical scope exposed by the plugin according to your permissions matrix:"
msgstr ""

