msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/views/tab-docs.php:315
msgid "This plugin embeds the Plugin Update Checker (PUC v5.6). Whenever a new GitHub Release is tagged and published with a higher version number, your WordPress installation will automatically notify you and allow 1-click updates right from your Plugins dashboard."
